1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,740
No rain had fallen for forty days.

2
00:00:03,850 --> 00:00:07,490
The fields cracked. The streams ran dry.

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:11,240
A thirsty crow found an old water jar.

4
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:15,440
There was water inside, but far too deep to reach.

5
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:20,140
She pushed. It would not tip. She pecked. It would not break.

6
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:23,160
Then she looked down at the pebbles.

7
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:26,870
One stone. Then another. Then another.

8
00:00:26,950 --> 00:00:31,370
The sun burned. Her wings ached. She kept going.

9
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:35,320
And slowly, the water rose.

10
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:38,190
Until at last, she drank.
